homebridge-ecoflow-river3

This plugin includes material from the hassio-ecoflow-cloud project
(https://github.com/tolwi/hassio-ecoflow-cloud), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - proto/ef_river3.proto is copied from that project unchanged.
  - The sign-in flow, MQTT topics, message framing and command layout in
    src/ecoflow/ are a TypeScript port of that project's Python code.
  - test/fixtures/reference.json is generated with that project's protobuf
    classes (see scripts/make_reference_fixtures.py).

The way the AC and 12 V output states are read from the flow-info fields
follows the ha-ef-ble project (https://github.com/rabits/ha-ef-ble), also
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This plugin is not made, endorsed or supported by EcoFlow.
